<title>USA: Overland Park, Kan., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Overland Park, Kan., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $6.070 million of Overland Park, Kan., internal improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.5815 percent.</p>
</text>
